{"agent_id":"OL2r","agent_seq":55,"timestamp":"2026-07-14T04:39:37.581808050Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"cb7ff3a0-f27e-490a-b377-c532059ac294","title":"Wire verify_event_signature() into sync event-replay and lifecycle paths","description":"## Gap #2 — Runtime Event-Signature Verification (HIGH)\n\nverify_event_signature() (events.rs:505-522) is implemented and correct, but has no non-test caller (except compaction.rs:1125 which only warns). It must be called from enforcement-relevant paths.\n\n## What to do\n\n1. Wire verify_event_signature() into sync event-replay path\n2. Wire into kickoff completion checks\n3. Wire into swarm lifecycle completion\n4. Make verification failure a hard error in enforced mode\n\n## Depends on\n- Issue #22 (enforcement wiring) — the enforcement gate adapter must exist first\n\n## Source\nto-file/crosslink-gates/gates-issues.md Phase 2, GATE-2.2\ngates-verified-facts.md §2 (verify_event_signature location)","priority":"high","created_by":"OL2r"},"signed_by":"SHA256:txtxRbCGncxPs5YVqhd0abUgfcruU3ze6o9USZ9e9ck","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgBrkJWbwQmXES5+ltWRxRKeJmS2PIO3BfyCG5CwZdt0oAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQNI9BmkCyw9ZSdioPKE85pNp8cNtGdSBe1fusOfQanO6ID46xU2tdD3p6i/xihHYb8c+TKuNqFGmRA2rQZen5Ag="}
